sentences.text:
Hence the sentence imposed on the applicant/accused is suspended till the disposal of the appeal subject to the following conditions:-
in i) The applicant/accused shall be released on bail on executing a bond for 50,000/-
(Rupees fifty thousand only) with two solvent sureties each for the like sum to the satisfaction of the trial court;
ii) He shall deposit the entire fine amount within a period of one month from the date of receipt of a copy of this order;
iii) He shall not commit any offence(s) while on bail;
Prabin. N vs State Of Kerala on 7 February, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/140322407/
